<html><head><title>Communication</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">The slogan </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">“communication</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is key</span><span style="margin: 0px">”</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"> is hopefully</span><span style="margin: 0px"> something</span><span style="margin: 0px"> you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> now</span><span style="margin: 0px"> understand</span><span style="margin: 0px"> to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> highly</span><span style="margin: 0px"> relevant to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px">. But this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is easier</span><span style="margin: 0px"> said</span><span style="margin: 0px"> than</span><span style="margin: 0px"> done</span><span style="margin: 0px">. What</span><span style="margin: 0px"> should</span><span style="margin: 0px"> you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> consider</span><span style="margin: 0px"> when</span><span style="margin: 0px"> it</span><span style="margin: 0px"> comes</span><span style="margin: 0px"> to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> communication</span><span style="margin: 0px">? At </span><span style="margin: 0px">the </span><span style="margin: 0px">heart of </span><span style="margin: 0px">it lies </span><span style="margin: 0px">the concept of a </span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">shared language</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">The </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">theory page</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"> and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">practice page</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"> will</span><span style="margin: 0px"> help you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> explore</span><span style="margin: 0px"> this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> further</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span>&nbsp;</span></font></p></body></html>